Comment: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:21.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:28.64,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.47,0:01:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Earth Federation has decided to launch\Nits attack on the special mining base...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...protected by M'Quve's forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is the start of Operation Odessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:47.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}General Revil has sent\Nall of his forces against M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Although the White Base has\Nreturned to the front lines...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:11.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...it was at the cost of many lives\Nincluding Lt. Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please make the bare minimum of repairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:34.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The operation has already started!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.60,0:02:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just have it ready so I can get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know, I know! Don't yell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:42.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give him a break. He's a bit edgy\Nafter the loss of Lieutenant Matilda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the same goes for me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.88,0:03:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't be preoccupied, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to launch. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're scouting the White Base's route...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...while also getting me used to this thing.\NYou'll help me, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The G-Armor's taking off!\NStep back now, Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. I'm going to use these Gundam\Npower-up parts that Ms. Matilda brought us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to do some practice runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Ms. Sayla.\NPlease do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mr. Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do anything.\NJust let me know if you get an SOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fried Chicken, deployment complete!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Air Forces are running slow.{\i}\N{\i1}Someone do something about that!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We need them to send another Dobday!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:28.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Borscht team from M'Quve's forces,{\i}\N{\i1}you're too far out in front!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Spirit of Mash...\NMay you soar into space...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and drift in eternal happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware these soldiers\Nwere recommended by Lady Kycilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But how long are they going to waste\Ntime and energy like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gaia. Ortega. The operation has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We know that already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:05:00.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have our revenge, no need to nag us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not a revenge mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take out the Trojan Horse that's threatening\Nus from behind. That's the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.68,0:05:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ortega! We're heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.81,0:05:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be approaching\Nthe enemy soon, Ms. Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger! Let me try the touch-and-go\None more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:57.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're receiving a message through\Ncode modulation circuit, alpha-gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? From General Revil?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"At 0630 hours, the White Base is to\Nattack M'Quve's base from the rear."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Contact the G-Armor, Fraw Bow,\Nand tell them to return to the White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:15.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...using cross cycle W.F.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... sir. W.F?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:18.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you really do it properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I can. You just keep quiet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's front line is this close?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:38.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did they notice us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:41.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please lower our altitude now, Ms. Sayla!\NThey may have spotted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like a propeller-driven plane.\NI'm not that certain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but I don't think it's one of Zeon's planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll check.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:54.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Dragonfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A small ferry plane used by the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did it just come out of a Zeon base?\NAnd how come it wasn't shot down?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a message from the White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Return to ship immediately."\NWhat should we do, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you curious, Ms. Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... Shall we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:17.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Ms. Matilda did say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...that Zeon seemed to know\Nevery move her Medea would make.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spy? It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if the Medeas were shot down\Nbecause of a spy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:41.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we need to reveal the truth\Nbefore we begin the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:45.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright! Enemy machines approaching\Nfrom one o'clock, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:47.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!\NHeaded straight for us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. But they couldn't have\Ndetected us at this altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:54.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's our proof that we have a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare for anti-air combat.\NGuntank, Guncannon, prepare to sortie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, hold on a moment!{\i}\N{\i1}Isn't this ahead of the operation's schedule?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy isn't going to wait\Nuntil it's convenient for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, okay.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, Amuro. The Dragonfly has landed\Non the Federation's Big Tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! Wait for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself! Name and assignment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:57.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam of the White Base!\NMy name is Amuro Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam? This thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, I need you to tell me\Nwhere I can find the pilot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...of the Dragonfly that just landed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Judock's ferry plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's ordered you to betray your own forces\Nas soon as the operation begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M'Quve is a rather restless man, isn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since M'Quve knows you won't be attacking...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...he has also ordered his main forces\Nto focus on General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! We've caught a suspicious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suspicious...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we talk alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may all leave the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Depending on what's discussed in that room,\Nwe might need to interrogate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This picture was taken by an official\Nmilitary data-processing camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and can be used as evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me that\Nwe have a spy aboard the Big Tray?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. If we enlarge the negative,\Nwe should be able to verify the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're suggesting that Judock is this spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's capital punishment.\NFor Judock...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and for you, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody will ask questions\Nif a single person is killed. And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a general.\NNobody will listen to a child like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I thought it was impossible,\Nbut... It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of people like you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could say I'd spare your life\Nin exchange for the negative...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro... Great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have this whole conversation on video.\NIt's more than enough evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will remain in the brig\Nuntil the operation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to say you had your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of people like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...dozens of people\Nhave died for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:38.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of people like you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Son...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.06,0:11:44.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's leave the rest for the court martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The White Base seems to\Nbe engaged in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suggest you return at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our forces will begin the attack{\i}\N{\i1}from M'Quve's flank!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Tray, maximum speed!{\i}\N{\i1}G-Armor, prepare for takeoff!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro. We're taking off. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:05.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The battle of Odessa has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Both M'Quve's and Revil's forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:52.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...are headed straight for each other,\Ndeploying their maximum resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the White Base is no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! The Guntank won't stand a chance\Nagainst these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Retreat, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:24.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hands off this one, Dopps!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:26.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just focus on downing the Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and bring in the Guntank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep the mobile suits away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! I hope you'll be back real soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,G-Armor is returning,\Nfrom one o'clock, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:14:00.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good! Prepare to launch the beam rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! I can see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How's the battle going?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Guntank has returned.\NA caterpillar tread was smashed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Mr. Kai's Guncannon is out there alone.\NHe's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay. Just stay calm and tell me{\i}\N{\i1}exactly what's happening in battle. Got it?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:20.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.21,0:14:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'll be okay, 'cause I'm with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm out of shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's that white mobile suit?\NThe one that killed Mash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're the mobile suits\Nfrom last night, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough to defeat them\Nwithout the Gundam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna convert?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.55,0:15:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,White Base, can you hang on for 20 secs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright! Amuro's asking for 20 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got no choice. Tell Kai to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is for Mash!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Retreat behind the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:22.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where does that bomber think it's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.82,0:15:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Separating G-Armor parts.\NPattern G!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pattern G, acknowledged. Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,4... 3... 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...1... 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one that got Mash appeared\Nwhen that bomber came out. That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm coming in for a landing, White Base.\NAll clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Any damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A bit along the front.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll replace it with Hayato's Core Fighter.\NPlease land on the port-side deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aligning laser axis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once it's in the hangar, we'll remove\Nthe front and attach Hayato's Core Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger! Docking release, set.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.45,0:16:52.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! You'd better not crash it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does anybody ever take off\Nhoping to crash their fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:20.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The first line to be broken was where\NM'Quve's forces were spread thin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:23.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...counting on General Elran's betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:26.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the two Dom mobile suits...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...were caught up with their battle against\NGundam, and unable to join the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As a result, the Zeon forces lacked\Nenough strength to stop the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, even at this critical moment,\NM'Quve still had a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is addressed to General Revil,\Ncommander of Operation Odessa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do not withdraw your forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we are prepared to use hydrogen bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:08.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, this goes against the Antarctic Treaty\Nprohibiting the use of nuclear weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we don't want to lose, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:27.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is said that General Revil\Ndid not say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:31.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He simply waved his hand\Nto indicate that his forces were to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Using those same tactics again?\NDon't take us for fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:13.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Ortega... He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'll get you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro! Do you read me?{\i}\N{\i1}The enemy is using a hydrogen bomb!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:21.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A hydrogen bomb?! But that's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, it is. The enemy is using{\i}\N{\i1}a weapon that must never be used.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have 30 seconds{\i}\N{\i1}before the missile launch.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget about the mobile suit.\NOur priority is to destroy the missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...! There's no way I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sending you some data.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:39.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The red area is the trigger mechanism.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You just need to cut{\i}\N{\i1}across the dotted line.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But can such a crude diagram...\Nreally be of any use?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not sure.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was released when the Antarctic Treaty{\i}\N{\i1}was signed, so at least it's reliable.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Incoming!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's a real hydrogen bomb,\Nwe'll all be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to do it, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.56,0:20:03.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's real...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hayato! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Doms can perform stunts like yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! You mean Revil's forces\Nhaven't stopped their advance?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. They're very close to breaking through\Nour final line of defense, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those fools...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an enemy mobile suit\Nbattling with a Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the Federation Forces have taken\Ndrastic measures against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give them what they asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But sir, it's too late to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is how the game is played.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Federation has blatantly\Nignored our demands_
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they must now\Nface the consequences...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch the missile!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can... I do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mash...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ortega...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Operation Odessa has ended in victory\Nfor the Federation Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, M'Quve has escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:26.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...on the Zanzibar warship that had\Nbrought the Black Tri-Stars to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This battle isn't the end of the war...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.83,0:22:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the amount of mineral\Nresources we've sent...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:42.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Zeon can fight for another 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:00.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The young crew of the White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...are introduced to General Revil\Non friendly terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Mad Angler squadron deploys\Nthe amphibious mobile suit Gogg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.84,0:23:24.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In order to crush the Trojan Horse\Nand destroy the Gundam...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Goggs attack with extraordinary tactics\Nas they threaten the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, the commander of the Mad Angler\Nsquadron is none other than...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NChar Returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:40.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
